# Formatting in this repo is opt-in for scripts/ only — everything else is ignored.
#
# The content pages, Liquid templates, SCSS and front-end JS were all authored before
# Prettier existed here; running it over them produces hundreds of changed lines per
# file, which would bury real changes in review noise.

# Build output, caches and dependencies
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.sass-cache/
node_modules/
vendor/

# Liquid templates and every other HTML file
_includes/
_layouts/
**/*.html

# Content pages
**/*.md
**/*.markdown

# Jekyll data and generated artifacts — site-index.json is owned by ssjs-data
_data/
site-index.json

# Styles and front-end JavaScript
_sass/
assets/
sw.js

# Site and CI configuration
_config.yml
.github/
manifest.webmanifest
